---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact ExpatWon"
  description="Get in touch with ExpatWon — corrections, questions about money in Korea, or partnership inquiries."
>
  <article class="prose-article mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="mb-4 font-display text-4xl font-bold text-ink">Contact</h1>

    <p>
      Found an outdated figure, a broken link, or a rule that changed? That is
      the most useful email we can receive — every article shows a
      "last verified" date and we update guides when readers flag changes.
    </p>

    <p>
      Email: <a href="mailto:contact@expatwon.com">contact@expatwon.com</a>
    </p>

    <h2>What to include</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>For corrections: the article URL and a link to the official source.</li>
      <li>For questions: your situation in one or two sentences (visa type helps).</li>
      <li>For partnerships: who you are and what you are proposing.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      We read everything but cannot provide personal financial, legal, or tax
      advice — see the <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
